## Conclusion

The Solar Powered Iron Press is capable of collecting approximately **250 W** of solar thermal energy. After accounting for thermal losses, the system delivers **180–200 W** of useful heat with an estimated efficiency of **76%**, demonstrating the feasibility of solar thermal energy for domestic ironing applications.

